        {
          "id": "a_2",
          "recognizedLabel": "3.",
          "normalizedRecognizedLabel": "3",
          "text": "Chloroplasts are the organelles where photosynthesis happens. They contain the green pigment chlorophyll which absorbs light energy from the sun.",
